      "text": "A wire is bent into the shape of the graph of \\( f(x) = \\frac{5 x \\sqrt{x + 1}}{2} \\) for \\( 3 \\le x \\le 6 \\), with x and y measured in inches. Using a calculator, find the length of the wire. Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
